---
description: GSAP and Lenis animation conventions for landing page and screen transitions
globs: app/page.js,components/**/*Scroll*,components/**/*Animation*
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use GSAP + GSAP ScrollTrigger for scroll-driven animation; use Lenis.js
  for smooth scrolling.
- The landing page compass must be a CSS/SVG element with scroll-scrubbed
  rotation/opening — never a 3D model, Three.js object, or frame-sequence
  canvas (see Hard Constraints).
- Prefer subtle, purposeful motion (parallax layers, staged reveals) over
  simple fade-in/fade-out.